\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The evaluation family. Intervention scores test interventional control (P1): $\phi _{\mathrm  {cf}}$ sufficiency to impose, $\phi _{\mathrm  {sup}}$ necessity to sustain. Ablation faithfulness tests \labelcref  {eq:p2}: pinned measures node selection, free measures whether the circuit reproduces the seed alone, and each free variant names its ablation semantics $\pi $ (\cref  {sec:problem}). The $\alpha $ rows score weighted circuits with their amplitudes applied (\cref  {sec:weighted}). SAE reconstruction errors are preserved in every row.}}{10}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:semantics}{{1}{10}{The evaluation family. Intervention scores test interventional control (P1): $\phicf $ sufficiency to impose, $\phisup $ necessity to sustain. Ablation faithfulness tests \labelcref {eq:p2}: pinned measures node selection, free measures whether the circuit reproduces the seed alone, and each free variant names its ablation semantics $\pi $ (\cref {sec:problem}). The $\alpha $ rows score weighted circuits with their amplitudes applied (\cref {sec:weighted}). SAE reconstruction errors are preserved in every row}{table.1}{}}
\newlabel{tab:semantics@cref}{{[table][1][]1}{[1][10][]10}{}{}{}}
