\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Control is sparse; faithfulness is collective; amplitudes collapse its cost. Cumulative score against members added in attribution order (three seeds per depth band: median curves, individual seeds ghosted; position-aware path attribution, percentile selection). Pinned faithfulness (node selection) rises steeply within $10^{2}$--$10^{3}$ members, while free faithfulness (the circuit alone, at natural amplitudes) sits near zero until $10^{4}$--$10^{5}$ members, under the mean fill (solid) and zero fill (dashed), each free variant naming its semantics. The shaded pinned--free gap widens with seed depth. Diamonds: \emph  {weighted circuits} discovered on the same seeds (\cref  {sec:weighted}), scored with their learned amplitudes applied under the zero fill, a few hundred members reaching the score the natural-amplitude curve needs $10^{5}$ for.}}{13}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:drivers-closure}{{2}{13}{Control is sparse; faithfulness is collective; amplitudes collapse its cost. Cumulative score against members added in attribution order (three seeds per depth band: median curves, individual seeds ghosted; position-aware path attribution, percentile selection). Pinned faithfulness (node selection) rises steeply within $10^{2}$--$10^{3}$ members, while free faithfulness (the circuit alone, at natural amplitudes) sits near zero until $10^{4}$--$10^{5}$ members, under the mean fill (solid) and zero fill (dashed), each free variant naming its semantics. The shaded pinned--free gap widens with seed depth. Diamonds: \emph {weighted circuits} discovered on the same seeds (\cref {sec:weighted}), scored with their learned amplitudes applied under the zero fill, a few hundred members reaching the score the natural-amplitude curve needs $10^{5}$ for}{figure.2}{}}
\newlabel{fig:drivers-closure@cref}{{[figure][2][]2}{[1][12][]13}{}{}{}}
